{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">ROW-STATE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310553","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ROW-STATE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ROW-STATE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">ROW-STATE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns an INTEGER value that represents the\ncurrent change state of a static ProDataSet temp-table buffer.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__syntax_GC1A16N2702913\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d153687e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__idGDO2WW2676135\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>ROW-STATE( <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The name of a ProDataSet temp-table buffer (preferably a before-image\ntemp-table buffer).</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__notes_GC1A16O2702919\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d153687e140\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">The\nROW-STATE function corresponds to the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ROW-STATE-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ROW-STATE-attribute.html\">ROW-STATE attribute</a>.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">When the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TRACKING-CHANGES-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TRACKING-CHANGES-attribute.html\">TRACKING-CHANGES attribute</a> is set to TRUE for a ProDataSet temp-table, the\nAVM tracks changes to the data in that temp-table using a before-image temp-table\nthat contains the original version of each modified row. You can\nthink of the temp-table itself as the after-image because it contains\nthe latest version of each row.<p class=\"p\">Every row in the after-image table\nthat has been modified or created corresponds to a row in the before-image\ntable. Deleted rows do not appear in the after-image table, because\nit reflects the current state of the data. Every row in the before-image\ntable has a non-zero ROW-STATE, because every row is the before-image\nof a deleted, created, or modified row in the after-image table.\nUnchanged rows do not appear in the before-image table.</p><p class=\"p\">You\ncan use the ROW-STATE function on each row in either the after-image\ntable or the before-image table to determine whether a row has changed\nand how it has changed.</p></li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The possible return values can be expressed as compiler constants. The following table\n          lists these values.<table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141\"><caption><span class=\"table--title-label\">Table 1. </span><span class=\"title\">Row state values</span></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:33.33333333333333%\" /><col style=\"width:12.121212121212121%\" /><col style=\"width:54.54545454545454%\" /></colgroup><thead class=\"thead\">\n                <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n                  <th class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__1\">Compiler constant</th>\n                  <th class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__2\">Value</th>\n                  <th class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__3\">Description</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n                <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__1 \">ROW-UNMODIFIED</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__2 \">0</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__3 \">The row was not modified.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__1 \">ROW-DELETED</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__2 \">1</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__3 \">The row was deleted.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__1 \">ROW-MODIFIED</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__2 \">2</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__3 \">The row was modified.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__1 \">ROW-CREATED</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__2 \">3</td>\n                  <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ROW-STATE-function__row-state-values_GDO2WX2676141__entry__3 \">The row was created.</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody></table></li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The ROW-STATE function returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>) when\nthe specified temp-table buffer:<ul class=\"ul\"><li class=\"li\">Does not contain a record</li><li class=\"li\">Is an after-image table with no associated before-image table</li></ul></li>\n        <li class=\"li\">You can invoke the ROW-STATE function from within a WHERE clause\n(unlike the corresponding attribute). For example:<table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__idGDO2WY2676146\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\"><tr class=\"row rowsep-0\"><td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\"><pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>WHERE ROW-STATE(ttOrder) = ROW-MODIFIED.</code></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ROW-STATE-function__see-also_GC1A16Q2702930\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d153687e272\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Buffer-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Buffer-object-handle.html\">Buffer object handle</a>. <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ROW-STATE-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ROW-STATE-attribute.html\">ROW-STATE attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TRACKING-CHANGES-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TRACKING-CHANGES-attribute.html\">TRACKING-CHANGES attribute</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ROUTINE-LEVEL-ON-ERROR-UNDO-THROW-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ROUTINE-LEVEL-ON-ERROR-UNDO-THROW-statement.html\">ROUTINE-LEVEL ON ERROR UNDO, THROW statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ROWID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ROWID-function.html\">ROWID function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310553","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"ROW-STATE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ROW-STATE-function.html","type":"Manual"}